B: you went back to your bind point, bind closer to where you hunt | release sends you to your bind, set it in the nearest town
C: everyone forgets that the first time | classic, been there | that one gets all of us
?A: how do i bind | wheres the bind thing | does binding cost anything
B: stand by the bindstone in town and type /bind | find the bindstone near town and /bind
